ICOSale.setMinUsdPerTx
├── when called by the owner with a non-zero value
│   ├── it updates minUsdPerTx to the new value
│   └── it emits MinUsdPerTxUpdated with correct parameters
├── when called by the owner and overwriting a previous non-zero value
│   └── it updates minUsdPerTx to the new value and emits the event
├── when _minUsdPerTx is zero
│   └── it reverts with ZeroAmount and does not change state
└── when called by a non-owner
    └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount and does not change state
